{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1381.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"22906e74d424c412bcc6390b90f4b5805c9a905ec0afec532aec28afcc8b8f75","ja":"律子のイメージ","zh":"律子的形象","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1381.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"92ef54e0e7cc3d9bbe82bee002186ad2dcf37218054894b18731d073992f3736","ja":"それじゃあ、律っちゃんにどんなコーデが似合うか、\nアイデアがある人～！","zh":"那么，关于律子适合什么样的搭配，\n有想法的人举手～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1381.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"2db420ad5991e7b2d471534244c76300f6c61beaf5d939f5f190c863440c92d6","ja":"はい！　私は、みんなを優しくぽかぽかーって\n照らすイメージがいいと思いまーすっ！","zh":"好！我觉得能像暖洋洋的光那样，\n温柔照耀着大家的形象就很不错～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1381.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"66a70e1ced541286838d075ef5d34398b83b141dee3c03a9e3fca53fef51bb51","ja":"えっ、そんな、\n私に太陽みたいな優しいコーデって……。","zh":"哎，怎么会，\n像太阳一样温柔的搭配居然适合我什么的……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1381.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"6a36ddf3b5aeebcdc0f321747462426a5e51c7fb2bb731ae8c04165a9016871a","ja":"だって、律子さんはいつもみんなのことを\n優しく見守ってくれてるじゃないですか。","zh":"因为律子小姐一直都在温柔地\n注视着大家嘛。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1381.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"a9a28d76b76721fe22b0c080849c19e52568920937988452f1009682a238ea18","ja":"だから、太陽みたいだな～って！","zh":"所以才觉得像太阳一样啊～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1381.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"80e0bacd389974ff78d40c78e6c3ea9cdf5254c977dd16928a82ab6d9c6d4468","ja":"ん～……「みんなを照らしてる」っていうのは、\n分かる気もするけど……。","zh":"唔～……虽然我也觉得“照耀着大家”\n这种说法多少能理解……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1381.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"7b73875748103d8d1f292e3ce4c4eea3dcd319ba5f9bd0c89916d2d1d3e45f92","ja":"ミキ的には、もっとギラギラーって言うか……、\nガミガミ～ってカンジ？","zh":"美希觉得，应该说是更加闪闪发光——……，\n还是唠唠叨叨～的感觉？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1381.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"30d89ed5faf2c777bdde67565733016e3cc894105eab8586fde19939c48ced51","ja":"「ガミガミ」は太陽のイメージとは関係ないでしょ！\nまったく……。","zh":"“唠唠叨叨”跟太阳的形象根本没有关系吧！\n真是的……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1381.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"7088c206c06ac2927964f23587af8f700db3db9fe9d2004d4c56b3f2f7b5219b","ja":"でも「みんなを照らしているイメージ」っていうのは、\n素直に嬉しいわね。","zh":"不过说是“照亮大家的形象”，\n坦率讲我还是挺高兴的呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1381.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"53cc3acb07eb96d63267767f1605cadcb727979061f6e5f75ceb5131f59c28a3","ja":"え～っ！　そんなのつまんないよ～！","zh":"诶～！那样好无聊啊～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1381.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"75de034d7816043780b5d3ee16ff0b9bf742004c4ba2d33f3a854f54c093551f","ja":"こういうときこそ、律っちゃんにはいつもは着ない\nコーデにチャレンジしてもらうべきだよ！","zh":"这种时候，才更应该让律子去挑战一下\n平时不会穿的穿搭呀！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1381.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"1edbd7ad72ff7fca563a168155045cde73952859005e2a5974267ed62e5139cc","ja":"真美もそう思う！　律っちゃんは\nセメセメの情熱的な太陽も似合うはずだよ！","zh":"真美也这么觉得！律子她\n肯定也很适合热烈奔放的火热太阳！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1381.unity3d","item_key":"commands[49].text","source_sha256":"86e8f286ae36b6e404c9e2b73858e6783902d3d86e59f45f7ac17d831e35f71d","ja":"いつもは着ないようなコーデか……。","zh":"平时不会穿的这种穿搭吗……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1381.unity3d","item_key":"commands[50].text","source_sha256":"4dc3c02d15fa0517941e8db6e7f53eb320a4a94ee857a63d1cb2dadfae9876c2","ja":"たしかに、こういう機会に\nチャレンジするのも、いいかもしれないわね……。","zh":"确实，趁这种机会\n挑战一下，说不定也不错呢……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1381.unity3d","item_key":"commands[51].text","source_sha256":"78eccc6750c4756a18bef7010f65fed3345d80f4d6292ec754f0953a91848a07","ja":"それで、どういうのにするんですか？","zh":"那么，要选哪种呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1381.unity3d","item_key":"commands[52].text","source_sha256":"0ad4292ae1b7b9df687aa36310fca227fba9ba331bd5323bd8c52253722917a0","ja":"えっと……も、もうちょっとだけ考えさせて！\nまだどれがいいか、決められなくて……。","zh":"那个……再、再让我稍微考虑一下！\n我还决定不好要选哪个……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
